{
  "voice": "/Users/arthurfu/Downloads/ElevenLabs_2026-10-07T06_16_58_Adam - Radio Announcer_pvc_sp100_s45_sb55_v4.mp3",
  "duration": 116.36666666666666,
  "word_match_fraction": 0.9896907216494846,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "name": "01-tech-feed",
      "start": 0,
      "speech_end": 6.0,
      "text": "You open your feed for something new.\nSomehow, you keep returning to the same topics.",
      "end": 5.91,
      "duration": 5.91
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "name": "02-unexplored-interests",
      "start": 5.91,
      "speech_end": 14.74,
      "text": "The videos change.\nThe interests we explore can stay surprisingly familiar.\nWe began to worry that our interests were narrowing without us noticing.",
      "end": 14.83,
      "duration": 8.92
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "name": "03-spotify",
      "start": 14.83,
      "speech_end": 22.66,
      "text": "Research gave us a reason to take that question seriously.\nA Spotify study linked algorithmic listening with lower consumption diversity.",
      "end": 22.59,
      "duration": 7.76
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "04-feedback-loop",
      "start": 22.59,
      "speech_end": 30.66,
      "text": "Other researchers showed, in simulations, how recommendation feedback loops can make users' choices more similar and reduce the value they get.",
      "end": 30.57,
      "duration": 7.98
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "05-new-interests",
      "start": 30.57,
      "speech_end": 35.98,
      "text": "That raised a question for us:\nHow can we make unfamiliar interests easier to discover?",
      "end": 35.88999999999999,
      "duration": 5.319999999999993
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "06-brand-meaning",
      "start": 35.88999999999999,
      "speech_end": 45.22,
      "text": "This is OtherWise.\nOther, for another perspective.\nWise, for more thoughtful judgment.\nAnd an invitation to think otherwise.",
      "end": 45.209999999999994,
      "duration": 9.32
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "07-choose-interest",
      "start": 45.209999999999994,
      "speech_end": 51.38,
      "text": "Start with an interest you choose.\nOtherWise suggests unfamiliar but related topics across fields.",
      "end": 51.29,
      "duration": 6.080000000000005
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "name": "08-exploration-range",
      "start": 51.29,
      "speech_end": 56.18,
      "text": "You control how far to explore, from nearby ideas to broader connections.",
      "end": 56.11,
      "duration": 4.82
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "name": "09-follow-a-topic",
      "start": 56.11,
      "speech_end": 62.3,
      "text": "Follow a topic that catches your attention.\nSave it when you want to pursue it, and explore from that new starting point.",
      "end": 62.209999999999994,
      "duration": 6.099999999999994
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "10-interest-galaxy",
      "start": 62.209999999999994,
      "speech_end": 68.2,
      "text": "A galaxy map makes your exploration visible, so you can revisit discoveries and choose where to go next.",
      "end": 68.11,
      "duration": 5.900000000000006
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "name": "11-auralist",
      "start": 68.11,
      "speech_end": 80.98,
      "text": "Existing research gives this direction an initial basis.\nIn a small user study, Auralist produced more useful, previously unknown recommendations.\nIts authors also proposed letting users adjust the level of novelty.",
      "end": 80.89,
      "duration": 12.780000000000001
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "name": "12-purs",
      "start": 80.89,
      "speech_end": 85.1,
      "text": "PURS showed how unexpected recommendations could remain relevant.",
      "end": 85.00999999999999,
      "duration": 4.11999999999999
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "13-contribution",
      "start": 85.00999999999999,
      "speech_end": 95.38,
      "text": "Our proposed contribution is to bring these ideas into a general topic explorer:\ninterests you confirm, gradual exploration across fields, and a visual record of your journey.",
      "end": 95.28999999999999,
      "duration": 10.280000000000001
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "14-research-question",
      "start": 95.28999999999999,
      "speech_end": 103.8,
      "text": "We're developing it as both a product and a research project.\nNext, we want to test whether a new discovery today can grow into a lasting interest.",
      "end": 103.71,
      "duration": 8.420000000000002
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "name": "15-professor-invitation",
      "start": 103.71,
      "speech_end": 110.2,
      "text": "If your research connects with recommendation, learning, or human-computer interaction, we'd love your guidance.",
      "end": 110.11,
      "duration": 6.400000000000006
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "name": "16-end-card",
      "start": 110.11,
      "speech_end": 113.14,
      "text": "OtherWise.\nYour world, a little wider.",
      "end": 116.36666666666666,
      "duration": 6.256666666666661
    }
  ],
