  "subtitles": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.835,
      "text": "You open your feed for something new.",
      "scene": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.86,
      "end": 5.935,
      "text": "Somehow, you keep returning\nto the same topics.",
      "scene": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.96,
      "end": 7.215,
      "text": "The videos change.",
      "scene": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.24,
      "end": 10.535,
      "text": "The interests we explore\ncan stay surprisingly familiar.",
      "scene": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.56,
      "end": 14.855,
      "text": "We began to worry that our interests\nwere narrowing without us noticing.",
      "scene": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 14.88,
      "end": 18.155,
      "text": "Research gave us a reason\nto take that question seriously.",
      "scene": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 18.18,
      "end": 22.615000000000002,
      "text": "A Spotify study linked algorithmic listening\nwith lower consumption diversity.",
      "scene": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 22.64,
      "end": 24.935000000000002,
      "text": "Other researchers showed, in simulations,",
      "scene": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 24.96,
      "end": 28.615000000000002,
      "text": "how recommendation feedback loops\ncan make users' choices more similar",
      "scene": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 28.64,
      "end": 30.595000000000002,
      "text": "and reduce the value they get.",
      "scene": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 30.62,
      "end": 32.395,
      "text": "That raised a question for us:",
      "scene": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 32.42,
      "end": 35.915,
      "text": "How can we make unfamiliar interests\neasier to discover?",
      "scene": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 35.94,
      "end": 37.855000000000004,
      "text": "This is OtherWise.",
      "scene": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 37.88,
      "end": 39.915,
      "text": "Other, for another perspective.",
      "scene": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 39.94,
      "end": 42.195,
      "text": "Wise, for more thoughtful judgment.",
      "scene": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 42.22,
      "end": 45.235,
      "text": "And an invitation to think otherwise.",
      "scene": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 45.26,
      "end": 47.470000000000006,
      "text": "Start with an interest you choose.",
      "scene": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 47.78,
      "end": 51.315000000000005,
      "text": "OtherWise suggests unfamiliar\nbut related topics across fields.",
      "scene": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 51.34,
      "end": 53.335,
      "text": "You control how far to explore,",
      "scene": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 53.36,
      "end": 56.135000000000005,
      "text": "from nearby ideas to broader connections.",
      "scene": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 56.160000000000004,
      "end": 58.335,
      "text": "Follow a topic that catches your attention.",
      "scene": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 58.36,
      "end": 59.815000000000005,
      "text": "Save it when you want to pursue it,",
      "scene": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 59.84,
      "end": 62.235,
      "text": "and explore from that new starting point.",
      "scene": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 62.26,
      "end": 64.45499999999998,
      "text": "A galaxy map makes your exploration visible,",
      "scene": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 64.47999999999999,
      "end": 68.13499999999999,
      "text": "so you can revisit discoveries\nand choose where to go next.",
      "scene": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 68.16,
      "end": 71.195,
      "text": "Existing research gives this direction\nan initial basis.",
      "scene": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 71.22,
      "end": 73.05499999999999,
      "text": "In a small user study,",
      "scene": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 73.08,
      "end": 76.81499999999998,
      "text": "Auralist produced more useful,\npreviously unknown recommendations.",
      "scene": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 76.83999999999999,
      "end": 80.91499999999999,
      "text": "Its authors also proposed letting users\nadjust the level of novelty.",
      "scene": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 80.94,
      "end": 85.03499999999998,
      "text": "PURS showed how unexpected recommendations\ncould remain relevant.",
      "scene": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 85.05999999999999,
      "end": 89.91,
      "text": "Our proposed contribution is to bring these ideas\ninto a general topic explorer:",
      "scene": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 89.96,
      "end": 91.17499999999998,
      "text": "interests you confirm,",
      "scene": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 91.19999999999999,
      "end": 93.17499999999998,
      "text": "gradual exploration across fields,",
      "scene": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 93.19999999999999,
      "end": 95.31499999999998,
      "text": "and a visual record of your journey.",
      "scene": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 95.33999999999999,
      "end": 98.92999999999999,
      "text": "We're developing it as both a product\nand a research project.",
      "scene": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 98.97999999999999,
      "end": 99.93499999999999,
      "text": "Next, we want to test",
      "scene": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 99.96,
      "end": 103.73499999999999,
      "text": "whether a new discovery today\ncan grow into a lasting interest.",
      "scene": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 103.75999999999999,
      "end": 106.15499999999999,
      "text": "If your research connects with recommendation,",
      "scene": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 106.17999999999999,
      "end": 108.17499999999998,
      "text": "learning, or human-computer interaction,",
      "scene": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 108.19999999999999,
      "end": 110.13499999999999,
      "text": "we'd love your guidance.",
      "scene": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 110.16,
      "end": 113.27,
      "text": "OtherWise. Your world, a little wider.",
      "scene": 16
    }
  ]
}